---
export const prerender = true;
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Terms - Recipe Nutrition Calculator" description="Terms of use for the Recipe Nutrition Calculator, a free online tool for estimating recipe calories and nutrition." noindex>
	<section class="max-w-[720px] mx-auto px-md sm:px-lg py-3xl">
		<h1 class="text-display-lg text-ink mb-lg">Terms</h1>
		<div class="space-y-md text-body-md text-body">
			<p>
				Recipe Nutrition Calculator is provided as-is, for informational purposes only. Nutrition figures are
				estimates based on a curated ingredient database and automated unit conversion - they are not a
				substitute for professional medical or dietary advice, and shouldn't be relied on for medical
				decisions (e.g. severe allergies or clinical diets) without independent verification.
			</p>
			<p>
				There are no user accounts. Any recipe you analyze is stored under an unguessable link for up to 90
				days so it can be shared; anyone with that link can view the result.
			</p>
			<p>
				Don't use the URL-import or photo-upload features to submit content you don't have the right to
				process, or to attempt to abuse or overload the service.
			</p>
			<p>We may update these terms as the product evolves.</p>
		</div>
	</section>
</Layout>
